  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Counterproliferation Program (ICP): Chemical, Biological, and Radiological Workshop</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICP delivered the Chemical, Biological, and Radiological Workshop to twenty-nine mid-level law enforcement officials and scientists from several units within the Singaporean Police Force (SPF) to participants from the Singaporean Ministry of Defense and Ministry of Home Affairs. By sharing lessons learned based on recent regional WMD events and trends, the workshop aimed to enhance Singapore&apos;s abilities to work WMD issues at the national, inter-ministerial, and international cooperation level. The Singaporaeans are using the case study examples to address their WMD policy and procedures.</narrative>
  </description>
